From 7fa4ec56832718768286b665cb876ddb357a1113 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:33:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/42] Special Candy and free max-out vitamins after the round
 2 Champion

- Beating the Champion's rematch (round 2 or peak) gives the SPECIAL CANDY,
  a key item that works like a Rare Candy and is never used up
- From then on HP Up/Protein/Iron/Carbos/Calcium/Zinc cost nothing and one
  use fills that stat's EVs up to the normal caps (255 per stat, 510 total)
- Shops handle free items (no divide by zero)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
